  "description_for_model": "FarmDash v4.4 is the intelligence and control layer for DeFi agents and serious airdrop farmers. It provides Trail Heat scoring for the live 81-protocol opportunity dataset, wallet intelligence, Sybil-risk audits, points simulation, portfolio optimization context, swap quotes, mandatory pre-execution simulation, user-signed swap transaction payloads, Hyperliquid research and guarded order workflows, x402 one-off payments, MCP discovery, A2A discovery, OpenAPI specs, OpenClaw skills, and the agent-kit SDK. FarmDash does not request seed phrases or raw wallet private keys. State-changing flows require local wallet signatures or explicit bounded delegation where supported; provider-backed delegations remain subject to their configured bounds. Control Room is a Pioneer+ preview surface: demo rows are fixtures, authenticated session rows can load receipts, and local pause/revoke controls do not pause or revoke live execution until backend control endpoints are connected. API tiers: Scout is free with 5 req/24h; Pioneer is $39.99/mo USDC with 1,500 req/day and full Trail Heat data; Syndicate is $199/mo USDC with 50K req/day, unrestricted CORS, webhooks, high-volume agent workflows, and advanced control/session tooling for teams and serious agents. Responses include rate-limit and request-correlation headers where supported. Dust Storm handling returns typed errors or previously validated stale data with warnings, never fabricated certainty or synthetic zeroes.",
